<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 0, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 76, background: '#1E4FA8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>可达空间：为什么是一个圆环</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#CFE0F5' }}>M3 · 能力边界</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 12 }} />
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 186, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#E8EFF8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 96, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', fontFamily: 'Times New Roman', lineHeight: 1 }}>0.08</Text>
                <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>内边界 r_min（m）</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', opacity: 0.7, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>两段反向：|L₁ − L₂| = |0.30 − 0.22|</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#0E3F8C', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 96, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Times New Roman', lineHeight: 1 }}>0.52</Text>
                <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>外边界 r_max（m）</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#CFE0F5', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>两段同向：L₁ + L₂ = 0.30 + 0.22</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 640, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E8EFF8', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <svg width={600} height={296} viewBox='0 0 600 296'>
                    <circle cx='300' cy='148' r='118' fill='#E8EFF8' stroke='#1E4FA8' strokeWidth='2.5' />
                    <circle cx='300' cy='148' r='18' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#0E3F8C' strokeWidth='2' strokeDasharray='5 4' />
                    <line x1='300' y1='148' x2='300' y2='30' stroke='#1E4FA8' strokeWidth='2.5' />
                    <line x1='300' y1='148' x2='318' y2='148' stroke='#0E3F8C' strokeWidth='2.5' />
                    <circle cx='300' cy='148' r='5' fill='#0E3F8C' />
                    <text x='308' y='38' fill='#1E4FA8' fontSize='18' fontWeight='bold' fontFamily='Times New Roman'>r_max = 0.52</text>
                    <text x='330' y='142' fill='#0E3F8C' fontSize='17' fontWeight='bold' fontFamily='Times New Roman'>r_min = 0.08</text>
                    <text x='300' y='74' textAnchor='middle' fill='#0E3F8C' fontSize='16' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>末端可达区域</text>
                    <text x='424' y='212' fill='#0E3F8C' fontSize='15' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei' opacity='0.75'>这个环里每一点都到得了</text>
                    <text x='300' y='288' textAnchor='middle' fill='#1A2230' fontSize='15' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei' opacity='0.65'>L₁ = 0.30 m　L₂ = 0.22 m　｜　圆环：0.08 ≤ r ≤ 0.52（单位 m）</text>
                </svg>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E8EFF8', padding: 20, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>为什么是“环”，不是“圆”？</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', opacity: 0.8, lineHeight: 1.75 }}>两段同向能伸到 0.52 m，两段反向只能缩到 0.08 m —— 中间的距离都取得到。</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', opacity: 0.8, lineHeight: 1.75 }}>但最里面那一小圈（r 小于 0.08 m）永远够不到，因为第一段连杆自己就有 0.30 m。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 72, background: '#E8EFF8', padding: 18, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>判断：这两个数就是这台臂的能力边界</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', opacity: 0.8 }}>外边界由“能不能伸直”决定，内边界由“能不能缩回来”决定 —— 它们只和连杆长度有关，和角度无关。</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 44, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1A2230', opacity: 0.5 }}>第 3 章 · M3　平面正运动学：1R → 2R → 3R</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', fontFamily: 'Times New Roman' }}>17 / 21</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
